[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15723.91, "timestamp": "04:22:03", "text": "我这边显示的是合并后的聊天记录。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15726.229, "timestamp": "04:22:06", "text": "右下角那个。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15730.229, "timestamp": "04:22:10", "text": "我添加了 YouTube Twitch 踢人和聊天功能，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15733.67, "timestamp": "04:22:13", "text": "就是位于……上的水平物体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15736.75, "timestamp": "04:22:16", "text": "底部。但是，呃，我不知道是不是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15739.11, "timestamp": "04:22:19", "text": "显。我知道那个大屁股"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15741.349, "timestamp": "04:22:21", "text": "像Teon这样的主播试图"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15744.63, "timestamp": "04:22:24", "text": "在 YouTube、Twitch 上使用 multiream 和其他设备"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15747.75, "timestamp": "04:22:27", "text": "他将直播间的聊天记录合并了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15750.07, "timestamp": "04:22:30", "text": "YouTube 和 Twitch 聊天室曾经是一个统一的聊天室。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15752.71, "timestamp": "04:22:32", "text": "把事情联系起来，比如知道这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15755.309, "timestamp": "04:22:35", "text": "而不是为每个对象分别创建两个单独的聊天窗口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15760.309, "timestamp": "04:22:40", "text": "平台。嗯，是的，他明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15762.63, "timestamp": "04:22:42", "text": "Twitch之类的东西，嗯，它可能是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15765.189, "timestamp": "04:22:45", "text": "应该被封禁的内容以及你应该删除的内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15771.349, "timestamp": "04:22:51", "text": "东西。嗯，我觉得他们这样做的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15773.83, "timestamp": "04:22:53", "text": "当你拥有大量资源时，或许人们会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15778.67, "timestamp": "04:22:58", "text": "用踢脸的方式踢脸"}]